# Normalize line endings.
#
# Without this, checking the repo out on Windows and saving from an
# editor that writes CRLF turned every tracked file into a "modified"
# file: `git status` listed all 51 of them and `git diff` reported
# 5,546 insertions and 5,546 deletions - every line of the project -
# purely because the endings changed. A diff nobody can read is a diff
# nobody reviews.
#
# text=auto eol=lf: store LF in the repository, check out LF everywhere.
# Every tool in this project (Python, pytest, browsers) is fine with LF
# on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be touched by the above.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.db binary
